me":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8odXL99ki7fi2YPgvAd14w","review_id":"IGdzib0PktFDCRj0gEDacA","date":"2015-07-09T19:41:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9331710338592529,"text_excerpt":"I have loved Liberty's Kitchen since they opened their old location at Broad and Tulane. Their white beans are delicious and the shrimp and grits rival some of the best lunch spots in town. It's a mission driven spot, giving \"at-risk\" kids an opportunity to learn skills and have a job. I certainly appreciate giving them my business for this reason alone! Since they've moved to Whole Foods, they've really exploded. The restaurant is really beautiful and their menu has expanded to include more sandwiches and breakfast items. They also serve Starbucks, which is a nice perk as there aren't any other coffee shops in that area of town. It's a nice spot to meet for lunch and they offer a private..."},{"business_id":"8odXL99ki7fi2YPgvAd14w","review_id":"pKcxrYUiGa6L0OgeepjU8w","date":"2015-05-28T16:36:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9225766658782959,"text_excerpt":"Finally got around to trying this place out after missing it at its old location further up Broad Ave. Hardly having the opportunity to eat out for breakfast during breakfast hours, i was glad to get around to checking this spot from my bookmarks. The inside is nice, i dig the use of the wood theme, it's clean and cool. Instead of boring ol' number markers for orders, you're given the name of a neighborhood of the city as an identifier of your order. I like the little added local flare to things, it works without being too cheesy. Simply place your order with the clerk at the counter, get your hood, and it's brought out to you. I had the New Orleans breakfast sandwich which is basically a..."},{"business_id":"8odXL99ki7fi2YPgvAd14w","review_id":"23pTd-K9hFXiVG5w0siQag","date":"2019-10-21T21:37:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9166157245635986,"text_excerpt":"Excellent choice for lunch. I stopped in for a quick bite and ended up with the Shrimp and Grits special because, well, BACON. Not light, no sir, not light at all, what with the bacon and dark sauce and what I surmise was butter all up in there. The shrimp and grits was served with a green salad precisely and perfectly finished with a tart house dressing. Thanks to Yelp!, I ended up with a banana nut muffin that made a fine breakfast the next day. Service was prompt and friendly, and juvenile in a good way--the people working at this restaurant are all young folks who are learning by doing. And they do quite well in the same way you can go to NOCCA to watch jazz or theatre or recitals and..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8odXL99ki7fi2YPgvAd14w","photo_id":"DRVSQ9Krc00r4NWwvQa9Sg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DRVSQ9Krc00r4NWwvQa9Sg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8951432704925537},{"business_id":"8odXL99ki7fi2YPgvAd14w","photo_id":"lTax7gGWwHdSaRTXm7wXHA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lTax7gGWwHdSaRTXm7wXHA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.886362612247467},{"business_id":"8odXL99ki7fi2YPgvAd14w","photo_id":"pK-cVNtYuUHAJWCBvwBGvg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/pK-cVNtYuUHAJWCBvwBGvg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8383974432945251},{"business_id":"8odXL99ki7fi2YPgvAd14w","photo_id":"iSombUK1-I2F8CjiCI37JQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/iSombUK1-I2F8CjiCI37JQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8208301067352295},{"business_id":"8odXL99ki7fi2YPgvAd14w","photo_id":"uYaLu6iQ7ly2xTods_dQJw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uYaLu6iQ7ly2xTods_dQJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7725070714950562}]},"notebook_case":null}
